{
 "note": "voiced span of each narration phrase in the locked picture (seconds); new voices are time-fitted into these",
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In nineteen sixty-six, a computer program got its own inventor asked to leave the room.",
   "start": 0.37,
   "end": 5.106
  },
  {
   "text": "M I T.",
   "start": 5.641,
   "end": 6.314
  },
  {
   "text": "Joseph Weizenbaum built ELIZA to play a therapist,",
   "start": 6.57,
   "end": 9.482
  },
  {
   "text": "because a therapist can just ask questions.",
   "start": 9.626,
   "end": 11.609
  },
  {
   "text": "His secretary had watched him build it for months.",
   "start": 12.02,
   "end": 14.259
  },
  {
   "text": "She knew exactly what it was.",
   "start": 14.515,
   "end": 15.942
  },
  {
   "text": "She typed a few lines,",
   "start": 16.291,
   "end": 17.493
  },
  {
   "text": "turned around,",
   "start": 17.637,
   "end": 18.364
  },
  {
   "text": "and asked him to leave.",
   "start": 18.508,
   "end": 19.618
  },
  {
   "text": "Visitors poured out their secrets.",
   "start": 20.06,
   "end": 21.613
  },
  {
   "text": "Psychiatrists predicted fully automatic therapy.",
   "start": 21.869,
   "end": 24.339
  },
  {
   "text": "Carl Sagan pictured rows of therapy booths,",
   "start": 24.595,
   "end": 26.915
  },
  {
   "text": "like phone booths.",
   "start": 27.047,
   "end": 27.917
  },
  {
   "text": "But ELIZA had a problem.",
   "start": 28.359,
   "end": 29.652
  },
  {
   "text": "Close the session,",
   "start": 29.908,
   "end": 30.733
  },
  {
   "text": "and it forgot you ever existed.",
   "start": 30.865,
   "end": 32.427
  },
  {
   "text": "Luckily, it never judged you.",
   "start": 32.838,
   "end": 34.263
  },
  {
   "text": "Unluckily, it never remembered you either.",
   "start": 34.519,
   "end": 36.582
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the trick.",
   "start": 37.024,
   "end": 37.727
  },
  {
   "text": "ELIZA was a mirror.",
   "start": 37.921,
   "end": 38.947
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm sad,",
   "start": 39.203,
   "end": 39.767
  },
  {
   "text": "became, why are you sad?",
   "start": 39.911,
   "end": 41.033
  },
  {
   "text": "Like talking to your dog.",
   "start": 41.413,
   "end": 42.601
  },
  {
   "text": "He doesn't follow a word,",
   "start": 42.795,
   "end": 43.919
  },
  {
   "text": "but he looks at you like he does,",
   "start": 44.051,
   "end": 45.453
  },
  {
   "text": "so you keep talking.",
   "start": 45.585,
   "end": 46.586
  },
  {
   "text": "It got a name:",
   "start": 46.997,
   "end": 47.72
  },
  {
   "text": "the ELIZA effect.",
   "start": 47.864,
   "end": 48.842
  },
  {
   "text": "Sixty years later, Feeloy listens,",
   "start": 49.377,
   "end": 51.181
  },
  {
   "text": "and remembers.",
   "start": 51.326,
   "end": 52.063
  },
  {
   "text": "Your day, your people, the little things.",
   "start": 52.319,
   "end": 53.986
  },
  {
   "text": "ELIZA got its inventor sent out of the room.",
   "start": 54.397,
   "end": 56.631
  },
  {
   "text": "Feeloy just asks how your interview went.",
   "start": 56.887,
   "end": 58.828
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 59.27,
   "end": 60.754
  }
 ]
}